{% if audit is none %}
| Audit agreement | **{{ not_audited }}** | n/a | — | — |
{% endif %}

`recall` is pipeline recall and includes facts the interview never elicited;
`recall_elicited` is extraction's own recall over facts that were actually disclosed,
and is the metric the diff gate uses. Reporting one number would mix "the interview
did not elicit it" with "extraction missed it".

{% if audit is none %}
**{{ not_audited }}.** No hand-filled labels were found, so no agreement rate is
printed. The judge shares a model with the system under test, so its agreement with a
human is the only check on it — and a placeholder here would be worse than a gap.
{% else %}
Audit agreement from {{ audit.agreed }}/{{ audit.labeled }} hand-filled labels
({{ audit.sampled }} sampled{% if audit.source %}, {{ audit.source }}{% endif %}). Labels are keyed by
content hash, not list position.
{% endif %}

