## 3. Per-question yield

Captured facts per minute of interview, interviewer words included — it measures
interview time, not speaking time. Word counts come from the clean source transcript,
so adding ASR noise cannot move the ratio. No interval: this is a ratio, not a
proportion, and Wilson does not apply.

