## 5. Recall by disclosure type

A `needs_followup` fact that no follow-up probed was never disclosed, so extraction
could not have captured it. A `hedge` fact counts as captured when it is matched at
*generic* specificity; without that rule the row reads near zero for a reason that has
nothing to do with extraction.

